cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Generative AI Integration in R: LLM APIs and Structured Output"
abstract: >-
  R scripts that integrate large language models into economic and statistical
  analysis with the ellmer package: Google Gemini and Groq APIs, any
  OpenAI-compatible endpoint, structured output with typed schemas, checks of
  model figures against official statistics and AI-assisted coding with
  GitHub Copilot in RStudio.
authors:
